@startuml sequence-real-be
title Runtime Sequence: Real BE Mode\n(`VITE_USE_MOCK=none`, `VITE_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080`)

!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FAFAFA

actor User
participant "CreateView.vue" as VIEW
participant "default.ts\n(Orval generated)" as CLIENT
participant "axios.ts\n(mutator)" as MUTATOR
participant "Network\n(localhost:8080)" as NET
participant "ItemController" as CTRL
participant "ItemService" as SVC
database "items: List<Item>\n(in-memory)" as DB

== ボタンタップ（POST /api/items） ==

User -> VIEW: 「登録」ボタンをタップ\n(name="新商品", price=300)
VIEW -> CLIENT: createItem({ name, price })
CLIENT -> MUTATOR: request<Item>({\n  url: '/api/items',\n  method: 'POST',\n  data: { name, price }\n})
MUTATOR -> NET: HTTP POST localhost:8080/api/items\nContent-Type: application/json

note over NET
  CORS preflight OPTIONS が
  先に飛ぶ場合あり
  → CorsConfig.java で 5173 許可済み
end note

NET -> CTRL: @PostMapping  ItemController.createItem(body)
CTRL -> SVC: service.create(itemCreate)
SVC -> DB: items.add(new Item(nextId++, ...))
note over SVC
  synchronized で保護
  AtomicLong で id 採番
end note
DB --> SVC: stored
SVC --> CTRL: Item(id=1, name="新商品", price=300)
CTRL --> NET: 201 Created\n{ id, name, price }
NET --> MUTATOR: response
MUTATOR --> CLIENT: Item
CLIENT --> VIEW: Item
VIEW -> User: router.replace('/')\n→ ListView へ遷移

== 一覧画面（GET /api/items） ==

User -> VIEW: ListView.onMounted
VIEW -> CLIENT: listItems()
CLIENT -> MUTATOR: request<Item[]>(...)
MUTATOR -> NET: HTTP GET /api/items
NET -> CTRL: @GetMapping  listItems()
CTRL -> SVC: service.listAll()
SVC -> DB: List.copyOf(items)
DB --> SVC: [{ id:1, name:"新商品",... }]
SVC --> CTRL: List<Item>
CTRL --> NET: 200 OK + JSON
NET --> MUTATOR: response
MUTATOR --> CLIENT: data
CLIENT --> VIEW: Item[]
VIEW -> User: 一覧に「新商品 ¥300」が表示

note over User, DB
  ★ 永続化はインメモリ
  ★ サーバー再起動で消える
  ★ 永続化したいなら H2/JPA を後付け
end note

@enduml
